{"title":"迎新春　颂新风","authors":["丁兆庆","陆汝浩"],"dates":[{"year":1977,"month":2,"day":20}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"陆汝浩　丁兆庆"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深入揭批“四人帮”，思想生产大解放"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"向雷锋同志学习"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"——你家有几口人?——有爷爷、奶奶、爸爸、妈妈和我，还有你们呐，咱们都是一家人。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬天里的春天"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}